</span> <span begin="0:47.111" end="0:47.431">vii</span> <span begin="0:47.431" end="0:47.750">la</span> <span begin="0:47.750" end="0:49.880">Domnul</span> <span begin="0:49.880" end="0:52.862">negreșit!</span></p><p begin="0:52.862" end="0:59.465" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:52.862" end="0:53.501">Lui</span> <span begin="0:53.501" end="0:54.140">mare</span> <span begin="0:54.140" end="0:56.270">milă-i</span> <span begin="0:56.270" end="0:56.980">e</span> <span begin="0:56.980" end="0:57.335">de</span> <span begin="0:57.335" end="0:59.465">tine,</span></p><p begin="0:59.465" end="1:06.955" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:59.465" end="0:59.820">Căci</span> <span begin="0:59.820" end="1:00.175">ești</span> <span begin="1:00.175" end="1:00.530">al</span> <span begin="1:00.530" end="1:01.595">Lui</span> <span begin="1:01.595" end="1:02.660">și</span> <span begin="1:02.660" end="1:03.370">te-a</span> <span begin="1:03.370" end="1:06.955">iubit!</span></p><p begin="1:06.955" end="1:13.666" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.955" end="1:08.014">Destul</span> <span begin="1:08.014" end="1:08.367">de</span> <span begin="1:08.367" end="1:09.427">mult</span> <span begin="1:09.427" end="1:10.487">ai</span> <span begin="1:10.487" end="1:11.193">stat</span> <span begin="1:11.193" end="1:11.546">ca</span> <span begin="1:11.546" end="1:13.666">slugă</span></p><p begin="1:13.666" end="1:20.447" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.666" end="1:14.019">Și-ai</span> <span begin="1:14.019" end="1:15.785">suferit</span> <span begin="1:15.785" end="1:16.844">pe</span> <span begin="1:16.844" end="1:18.858">lângă</span> <span begin="1:18.858" end="1:20.447">porci!</span></p><p begin="1:20.447" end="1:26.381" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.447" end="1:22.143">Te-oprește-acum,</span> <span begin="1:22.143" end="1:24.262">privește-n</span> <span begin="1:24.262" end="1:26.381">rugă:</span></p><p begin="1:26.381" end="1:30.749" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.381" end="1:27.088">Tatăl</span> <span begin="1:27.088" end="1:29.560">te-așteaptă</span> <span begin="1:29.560" end="1:30.266">să</span> <span begin="1:30.266" end="1:30.749">te-ntorci!</span></p><p begin="1:30.749" end="1:39.097" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.749" end="1:32.354">Ah,</span> <span begin="1:32.354" end="1:33.157">te</span> <span begin="1:33.157" end="1:36.100">grăbește,</span> <span begin="1:36.100" end="1:36.813">e</span> <span begin="1:36.813" end="1:37.170">mai</span> <span begin="1:37.170" end="1:39.097">bine</span></p><p begin="1:39.097" end="1:45.518" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.097" end="1:39.739">Să</span> <span begin="1:39.739" end="1:40.060">vii</span> <span begin="1:40.060" end="1:40.381">la</span> <span begin="1:40.381" end="1:42.521">Domnul</span> <span begin="1:42.521" end="1:45.518">negreșit!</span></p><p begin="1:45.518" end="1:52.153" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.518" end="1:46.160">Lui</span> <span begin="1:46.160" end="1:46.802">mare</span> <span begin="1:46.802" end="1:48.943">milă-i</span> <span begin="1:48.943" end="1:49.656">e</span> <span begin="1:49.656" end="1:50.013">de</span> <span begin="1:50.013" end="1:52.153">tine,</span></p><p begin="1:52.153" end="1:59.875" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.153" end="1:52.510">Căci</span> <span begin="1:52.510" end="1:52.867">ești</span> <span begin="1:52.867" end="1:53.224">al</span> <span begin="1:53.224" end="1:54.294">Lui</span> <span begin="1:54.294" end="1:55.364">și</span> <span begin="1:55.364" end="1:56.078">te-a</span> <span begin="1:56.078" end="1:59.875">iubit!</span></p><p begin="1:59.875" end="2:06.585" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.875" end="2:01.287">Domnul,</span> <span begin="2:01.287" end="2:02.347">nicicând,</span> <span begin="2:02.347" end="2:03.407">nu</span> <span begin="2:03.407" end="2:04.113">dă</span> <span begin="2:04.113" end="2:06.585">afară</span></p><p begin="2:06.585" end="2:12.730" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.585" end="2:06.938">Pe</span> <span begin="2:06.938" end="